neral-election polls; forecast rests on fundamentals and expert ratings.", "Open seat: Kevin Stitt (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Oklahoma's gubernatorial race is an open-seat contest between Republican Mike Mazzei and Democrat Cyndi Munson, with term-limited Governor Kevin Stitt not on the ballot. The state's strong Republican lean and the absence of any public polling showing a competitive race frame this as a heavily Republican-favored contest. Every major expert rater calls the race Solid or Safe R, and prediction markets give Munson only about a 7% chance of winning.\n\nThe campaign has featured a single debate and discussion of issues like data centers, abortion, and a proposed smelter, and the Democratic Governors Association praised Munson's debate performance. Former President Trump has campaigned in Oklahoma for Mazzei, reinforcing the partisan environment. Barring an unexpected late shift, Mazzei is positioned to win the governorship comfortably.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0232, "margin": -13.12}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0251, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0363, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0381, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.035, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0321, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0186, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.018, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0192, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0194, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0356, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0365, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0342, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0558, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0353, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0312, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0348, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10